# Bot2's Chain Lightning at Ms. Marvel is an opponent's spell: "you cast" is not Bot1, so nothing triggers. Bot1 (the creature's
# controller) pays {R}{R} to copy it (CR 707.10) and chooses its own Ornithopter as the copy's new target (CR 707.10c). The copy
# targets a creature Bot1 controls and Bot1 controls it, but a copy is put on the stack without being cast (CR 707.10, 601.2a): the
# stack is the copy alone, Bot1 draws nothing (empty hand), and Ms. Marvel's base power stays her printed 1. Ms. Marvel took 3 and
# lives; the Ornithopter dies to the copy.

